+/// state, then AP ON. `RtKit::boot` does the AP ON: its boot and IOP-ack completions are
+/// still complete from the IDLE transition, so it sends AP ON and waits for that ack only.
+/// If that fails, fall back to the INIT wake (the deepidle2 path).
